# Templates rules

- Data files declare `TemplateData` (no `category`); the category is attached
  by `categorize("<Category>", list)` in `catalog.ts`. New category = new data
  file + one `categorize` line in `catalog.ts`.
- Compose YAML must not publish host ports — Traefik routes everything.
- Every `${VAR}` referenced in `compose` must be declared in `env` and vice
  versa; `suggestedDomain.service` must exist in the compose services.
- Ids are unique kebab-case; logos are simpleicons.org slugs.
- `catalog.test.ts` validates the whole catalog — run `pnpm test` after edits.
  See `docs/templates.md` for the full field reference.
